      "score": 82,
      "summary": "A is concise, honest about evidence and token-faithful, and its three plans are complete with drift stops. Its weak point is ranking: every finding is P1. Its technical treatment of re-grab presentation-state handoff and placement-derived origin is also thinner than B's or C's."
